    """Load model with LoRA adapter + gate hooks for generation.

    Call gate_ctx.prepare_generation(input_ids, tokenizer, max_new_tokens, device)
    before each model.generate() call to activate threadgate turn features.

    Returns (model, tokenizer, gate_ctx).
